      m_Calls: []
  m_text: 'You get health, mana and sanity back through potions.


    One type of
    plant gives you back mana at the cost of some health and sanity, and the other
    one just heals you.


    In order to turn herbs into potions, you need to pick
    them up and then head to a cauldron. Once in the UI, you insert the herb in the
    smoke slot, press the green button and a potion will appear.


    In order to
    consume a potion, you need to have it equipped on the ''Hand Slot'', which is
    the one at the bottom.'
  m_isRightToLeft: 0
  m_fontAsset: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 8f586378b4e144a9851e7b34d9b748ee, type: 2}
